{"version":1,"content":"<p>特首李家超接納司法人員推薦委員會就任命新西蘭最高法院前常任法官區諾德，為終院海外非常任法官的推薦，會在徵得立法會同意後作出任命。</p><p>待區諾德獲任命，海外非常任法官數目將由目前的5名增至6名。</p><p>終院首席法官張舉能對此表示歡迎。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T10:19:50.664098+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T09:42:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T08:37:34.291859+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T10:17:36.682037+00:00","content_hash":"55955778bf9c860cc5f49c140dd61234ff3dc29c9a0a3e22592ffa341f5bcd26","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}